{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "e793de3367978f49fa2e72dac6ca7235a8366f789e87221daae573c16f07c5c7", "ja": "シグネチャーピースは？", "zh": "签名碎片呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "50fa1e91140f82032279c770c5c9ebc3cd3e87822d71a010478b59b6220383b3", "ja": "各ブランドのアイテムを使った、キービジュ\nアルの撮影。まずはスカジ組。自分達で品物\nを選ぶ流れで、歌織は持参した自分のバッグ\nに、真はキーケースに決まるが、朋花だけは\n難航してしまう。", "zh": "使用各品牌单品拍摄主视觉图。\n首先是斯嘉蒂组。按各自挑选物品的流程，\n歌织决定用自己带来的包，\n真定下了钥匙包，唯独朋花陷入了纠结。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "f431b7acccee8716150e88bc8dcdfdbb51546159a0aeeccf278c826bc2680b3a", "ja": "（今日は、ブランドアイテムを使っての撮影。\nまずは朋花たち、スカジのメンバーからだ）", "zh": "（今天是使用品牌商品拍摄主视觉图。首先轮到朋花她们，斯卡吉的成员们了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1001_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "89dbe389252211af6cf1af35649d4a378f6bb0ed1d4e81a9a749778685843cbf", "ja": "皆様にはこれらの新作から一点選んでいただき、\nそちらを身に着けて、撮影に臨んでいただきます。", "zh": "请各位从这些新作品中选择一件，穿上后参加拍摄。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1002_null", "source_sha256": "3db2cc6e2b66977fe2ec9ac89beb74629fea3d9450b67185b33e3f215d0df9f9", "ja": "ズラーーーッ！", "zh": "唰——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "5b09ec3a7eb464b0b40a63dd776310b509c55c8c3184a6acf8a8d94082498f6d", "ja": "うわっ！？　スカジがこんなにたくさん……\nすごいや！　これ全部で、幾らするんだろう……？", "zh": "哇！？好多横须贺夹克……\n好厉害！这全部加起来，得要多少钱啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b0f316795848252eb248e70c43174a0487ee6a549da8dc2bc57265555a8715bf", "ja": "バッグに靴に、アクセサリー類もあるな。\nおや？　値札が……ヒッ！？　さ、さんびゃく……！", "zh": "有包包、鞋子，还有各种饰品啊。  \n咦？价格标签上……呜哇！？三、三百……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "9c1b093866090e6a327d20ca7f1d2079c71d101b25cd8273c3e7b4224173d7df", "ja": "あの……私、自分のバッグを持ってきたんです。\nこちらなんですけど。", "zh": "那个……我把自己的包带来了。\n就是这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "b0f71c7558717c4c373b9e303a9396541ce9b89bbd4eb3b589f4c440a8f9a357", "ja": "大人びたデザインの、素敵なバッグですね～。\n歌織さんに、よく似合ってます～。", "zh": "款式很成熟，真是个漂亮的包包呢～。\n非常适合歌织小姐哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "0898fed9480f1bb5bfc163abcee308ed128d4f5464fe7b5ff5bb616f0d500a45", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとう、朋花ちゃん。でも、\n私も怖気づいてしまって、ずっとしまってあったの。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢你，朋花。不过，我也有些胆怯，一直把它收起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1008_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "c5f723af81b420a32e5161e874e8762a9ce64a3c717a28079c241e2a8038ee62", "ja": "スカジのシグネチャーピースのうちの一つですね。\n大切にしていただけていることが、一目でわかります。", "zh": "这是斯卡蒂的标志性作品之一呢。\n一眼就能看出，您一直珍爱着它。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1009_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "868dbb3b135eccc2dcb173ad15f46428d5e03d9e5a9896c4f400d07c254692e1", "ja": "十分、撮影に足る品物かと。\n桜守様は、こちらでご参加されますか？", "zh": "这些东西完全够用于拍摄了。\n樱守小姐，您要在这里参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "7133b78454cfbb7b921df5b17f723360c241a8a3e96a037ca76b376fa6574c91", "ja": "よければそうさせてください。私が不甲斐ないせいで、\n今まであまり使ってあげられませんでしたけど……", "zh": "如果可以的话，就请让我这样做吧。都怪我没用，一直没能好好派上用场……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "a975c56e733de19f8c7f6a5aa0f3009157dec6fab48486c4710fa8b1875721d5", "ja": "たまにはこの子も、晴れ舞台に……\n日の当たる場所に、出してあげたいので。", "zh": "因为偶尔也想让这孩子登上一次大舞台……出现在阳光下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1012_006mak", "source_sha256": "3b2062bb4dae651a0141c5496d8dfcc486531d3cde1f654461bac836ead2fbc3", "ja": "素敵な考え方ですね！　ボクはどれにしようかな？\nバッグは、リュックのようには使えないし……。", "zh": "真是个不错的想法！我该选哪个呢？包包又不能像背包那样用……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1013_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "3221b0a95ca6bf1821311b2081cb7a2eeae173e601238e6e65a3ede23732874d", "ja": "そこは、菊地様の普段使いと同じように\n扱っていただければ、よろしいかと。", "zh": "只要按菊地女士平时使用的方式处理就可以了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1014_p", "source_sha256": "b063928a31a5e9e04a5762d80908311ac4bc1d5811f844ed328cbf00eb3adaa7", "ja": "（それは……大丈夫なのか？\n壊してしまった場合、べ、弁償とか……）", "zh": "（那……没问题吗？\n要是不小心弄坏了，赔、赔偿什么的……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "2d74f34da9a812257765cad1ec8ec0c0e05b5d2ad77d66325b550dc4994feb37", "ja": "うーん……でも、あんまり繊細なアイテムだと、\n壊しちゃいそうで怖いなぁ。", "zh": "嗯……不过，要是太精巧的东西，我怕一不小心就会弄坏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1016_006mak", "source_sha256": "a2dfcde9fbb13a2bd07d063b0198f0f5f8d9cdd3dc1b3739dea485a4a4159e9c", "ja": "それだと、いい画にならない気が……\n……あ！　これとかいいかも？　キーケース！", "zh": "那样的话，感觉拍出来的效果不会太好……\n……啊！这个怎么样？钥匙包！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "cc5980d68b9aaa71369bdc07b2c0fbecf0e803d8576efdaf31025fa9fd5e5ba2", "ja": "真さん、いいんですか～？　バッグや靴と比べると、\nだいぶ目立たないような気もしますが～……。", "zh": "真先生，这样真的好吗～？和包包、鞋子比起来，我觉得好像不太显眼～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "b303ea634b60098afb4b1d5f70f1b0aeaebd82612c307bc3df61236aacc6818f", "ja": "うん！　でも、ボクのお小遣いでも買える範囲だし。\nこれなら、自然に見せられると思うんだ。", "zh": "嗯！不过，这个价格在我的零花钱承受范围内。\n这样的话，应该能显得很自然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1019_006mak", "source_sha256": "ff487022e37d6ce45082acd10cb32c42697bd7e7d63d1edd1fe25364be9f523b", "ja": "自転車のキーとか付けたら、アクティブじゃない？\nへへっ♪", "zh": "要是再挂上自行车钥匙之类的，不就显得很有活力了吗？\n嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1020_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "d0c46c58920d577828b888133108a2a7a15aabe2c595b12828054deb3c60429b", "ja": "ワタクシどものメゾンを、身近に感じていただく……\nそれも大切なことです。", "zh": "让您感到我们这家店就在身边……  \n这也是很重要的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1021_sukajikouhou", "source_sha256": "e3a2311ceb73454b6b6fae5b24cc5389b7a7baa9540f8d82bb7315ae92f9acd9", "ja": "個人的には、ラグジュアリーなお姿の菊地様も、\n拝見したくはありましたが……承知いたしました。", "zh": "就我个人而言，也很想看看身着奢华装扮的菊地小姐……我明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "ddda234b5229ba233cd90d29aebad1fa2de897b94c711ae2c5e68d4e5b2795b7", "ja": "残るは、私ですね～……さて、どうしましょうか～？", "zh": "剩下的就是我了呢～……接下来该怎么办好呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "01a96109b6edb4ea530d3adefcba55b8c49f2d9009c4e4997934927b0f921b5d", "ja": "私は、歌織さんほど大人っぽくありませんし。\n同じような方向性では、見劣りしてしまうでしょう～。", "zh": "我不像歌织小姐那么成熟。如果走相同的方向，应该会显得逊色吧～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1024_052kao", "source_sha256": "ad51d56690bc512528c00743cda191e59d800040aceda20359a93195dab32ada", "ja": "朋花ちゃんは、十分大人びているとは思うけど……\n中学生だし、仕方ないところはあるわよね。", "zh": "我觉得朋花已经够成熟了……\n不过她还是中学生，有些地方也是没办法的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1025_031tom", "source_sha256": "ad3a009d8b5bd0b214ab63f1edb2c2cf887d576b6f6704699c5a8f599f4e1ba9", "ja": "そうですね～、もどかしいですが……\nとはいえ、真さんと同じ作戦は採用できませんし～。", "zh": "是啊～，虽然让人有些着急……\n不过，也不能采用和真一样的策略嘛～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1026_p", "source_sha256": "5732905611b5b28b04f64b741321cbd1e71949cdaa61b479bf2813a31f95511d", "ja": "そうだな……キービジュのセンターともなると、\nある程度華やかさも求められるし……。", "zh": "没错……毕竟是主视觉图的C位，\n还是需要具备一定的华丽感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "3797d8a5d0af6399411906030964d46f5ab5361da06b65b88761133ab4bb4611", "ja": "う～ん……なかなか、難しいですね～。", "zh": "嗯……还真是挺难的呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1028_006mak", "source_sha256": "34649179d29639da1404bfd8be3273723dfcb615f7dbe7180f3de035b74eba6a", "ja": "今日は丸一日撮影だし、すぐ決めなくても\nいいんじゃない？　色々なアイテムを試してみたら。", "zh": "今天要拍一整天，也不用马上决定吧？不如试试各种道具。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1029_031tom", "source_sha256": "791d76e21074526839030b48da8f003d19c332b5ef8db2667e6fe016d6ea4a42", "ja": "はい～……では、それでお願いします～。", "zh": "好的～……那就拜托了～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1030_p", "source_sha256": "ef4fd07876b8c493c88b6ba536c9902666fcfba0070473bf9ab77e890335316e", "ja": "（その後、撮影が始まったが……朋花は\n何をメインにするか、最後まで決まらなかった）", "zh": "（之后，拍摄开始了，可是朋花直到最后也没决定好要以什么为主）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "3205b72a73673febffd5fbc98563b333312ac3be47d99257d39d9b0f4eca0f7a", "ja": "（朋花の撮影は次回に持ち越しとなり、\n今日のところは撤収となった）", "zh": "（朋花的拍摄只能安排到下次了，今天就先收工吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0440_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0440_story_03_1032_031tom", "source_sha256": "3687c91ad3b669484491db70cd3cb67f52cc6e7d314b9e2739c0ce93d3c48898", "ja": "ふぅ……歌織さん、真さん、すみません～。", "zh": "呼……歌织小姐，真小姐，对不起～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
